---
description: >-
  Same sibling-nesting deployment layout as diagram-types/deployment-diagram.mmd
  (Data Center containing an App Server and a DB Server, each wrapping a
  Container/ContainerDb), but built with the Node/Node_L/Node_R alias
  macros instead of Deployment_Node, to verify the aliases behave
  identically.
---
C4Deployment
title Deployment node aliases
Node(dc, "Data Center", "us-east-1") {
  Node_L(srv, "App Server", "Ubuntu 22.04") {
    Container(api, "API", "Java, Spring")
  }
  Node_R(dbn, "DB Server", "Ubuntu 22.04") {
    ContainerDb(db, "Database", "PostgreSQL")
  }
}
Rel(api, db, "reads/writes", "JDBC")
